From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Otto=20Pfl=C3=BCger?= <otto.pflueger@abscue.de>
Date: Tue, 15 Apr 2025 10:52:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 079/225] ASoC: sprd: add UMS9230 machine driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add a machine driver for the UMS9230 SoC. Only include the VBC DAIs by
default since these are always present on the SoC. The device-specific
codec links are read from the device tree.

Signed-off-by: Otto Pflüger <otto.pflueger@abscue.de>
---
 sound/soc/sprd/Kconfig            |  29 +++--
 sound/soc/sprd/Makefile           |   8 +-
 sound/soc/sprd/sprd-card-common.c | 166 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 sound/soc/sprd/sprd-card-common.h |  13 +++
 sound/soc/sprd/ums9230-card.c     | 169 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 376 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/sprd/sprd-card-common.c
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/sprd/sprd-card-common.h
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/sprd/ums9230-card.c

